{
  "_comment": "Ethereum, Base and Arbitrum profiles for Peal Links. Every namespace here is DISABLED: gateway and token addresses are empty on purpose, and the node marks a namespace available only after its watcher has verified the chain id, the gateway code and the token code against the RPC. Fill an address only after the deployment has been verified per docs/peal-links/MAINNET_READINESS.md. Token addresses and decimals must come from the issuer's official documentation and the on-chain contract, never from a ticker. This file carries no signer fixture: a mainnet namespace refuses the single-process signer fixture and the dev-mint flag.",
